{"lines":[{"t":"Reading","x":0.83545650073485112,"h":0.015594571318949924,"c":1,"y":0.044169165472625616,"w":0.08287218093872073},{"w":0.79466120402018225,"h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.082135516968107544,"c":1,"y":0.08997050139301177,"t":"Racket modifications mainly date back to the 1970s, when the amateur German tennis player"},{"c":1,"h":0.019486034021968357,"x":0.084118290909031265,"t":"Werner Fischer started playing with the so-called spaghetti-strung racket. It created a string bed","y":0.10694646516641115,"w":0.81327138264973975},{"h":0.016024387550916619,"c":1,"y":0.12645348848778915,"t":"that generated so much topspin that it was quickly banned by the International Tennis Federation.","x":0.082135530871711451,"w":0.8316221618652343},{"h":0.017461583185336638,"c":1,"w":0.80903493245442692,"x":0.084188899164949385,"y":0.14389534886096278,"t":"However, within a decade or two, racket modification became a regularity. Today it is, in many"},{"c":1,"t":"ways, an aspect of the game that is equal in significance to nutrition or training.","w":0.67782124837239588,"x":0.084075652328745559,"y":0.15993722839351343,"h":0.020889115685206905},{"h":0.01935313852135756,"y":0.19570830112996407,"x":0.082086349781682388,"t":"Modifications can be divided into two categories: those to the string bed and those to the racket","w":0.81529774983723957,"c":1},{"w":0.80707595825195311,"y":0.21359464310326071,"h":0.01888246114275105,"t":"frame. The former is far more common than the latter: the choice of the strings and the tension","c":1,"x":0.08208798494935611},{"c":1,"w":0.80903488159179693,"y":0.23097345171930472,"h":0.019026547547286943,"t":"with which they are installed is something that nearly all professional players experiment with.","x":0.082135532766729968},{"c":1,"x":0.082135533092023441,"y":0.24854651193616994,"t":"They will continually change it depending on various factors including the court surface, climatic","w":0.8316221618652343,"h":0.019005110974157136},{"c":1,"w":0.8069815063476562,"t":"conditions, and game styles. Some will even change it depending on how they feel at the time.","x":0.082135530090773734,"y":0.26889534886095612,"h":0.017535329498020946},{"w":0.82761144002278653,"c":1,"t":"At one time, all tennis rackets were strung with natural gut made from the outer layer of sheep or","x":0.082087881866245785,"y":0.30229982860733995,"h":0.019148963320571699},{"t":"cow intestines. This all changed in the early 1990s with the development of synthetic strings that","y":0.31977668493397848,"h":0.019014866021530574,"x":0.082078279779251292,"w":0.82558242797851566,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371857499573,"t":"were cheaper and more durable. They are made from three materials: nylon (relatively durable","x":0.080082142007573603,"c":1,"y":0.34011627918530252,"w":0.80698150634765631},{"w":0.78644765218098955,"x":0.080082128645644943,"h":0.017477876106194667,"t":"and affordable), Kevlar (too stiff to be used alone) or co-polyester (polyester combined with","y":0.35752212386472904,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.37492625370215904,"h":0.017515606725462152,"t":"additives that enhance its performance). Even so, many professional players continue to use a","x":0.082135523688193837,"w":0.79671457926432288},{"h":0.020481752153694743,"c":1,"y":0.3908554570512861,"w":0.71047225952148441,"x":0.082135527631455055,"t":"'hybrid set-up', where a combination of both synthetic and natural strings are used."},{"w":0.79466120402018237,"x":0.082135516984016027,"t":"Of the synthetics, co-polyester is by far the most widely used. It's a perfect fit for the style of","c":1,"h":0.016058688318483227,"y":0.42877906988312187},{"y":0.44622093025553289,"t":"tennis now played, where players tend to battle it out from the back of the court rather than","x":0.080082128345622727,"w":0.77823410034179674,"h":0.017495883952903246,"c":1},{"y":0.46366279071638994,"t":"coming to the net. Studies indicate that the average spin from a co-polyester string is 25% greater","x":0.082135530814693242,"w":0.8316221618652343,"h":0.017458153333635762,"c":1},{"w":0.78439422607421871,"y":0.48255813955803539,"h":0.017441860412777732,"x":0.082135535725528924,"c":1,"t":"than that from natural string or other synthetics. In a sense, the development of co-polyester"},{"y":0.49853331582151483,"t":"strings has revolutionised the game.","w":0.31245196024576821,"x":0.079930638096475756,"h":0.019278481857614937,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.082135516454564669,"w":0.77823410034179696,"y":0.53628318587769719,"t":"However; many players go beyond these basic adjustments to the strings and make changes","h":0.016042395397625198},{"c":1,"h":0.017533614572170619,"t":"to the racket frame itself. For example, much of the serving power of US professional player","x":0.082135529571779484,"y":0.55368731563145845,"w":0.79055440266927079},{"x":0.08207871065701644,"w":0.78450653076171872,"t":"Pete Sampras was attributed to the addition of four to five lead weights onto his rackets, and","y":0.56996671428871071,"h":0.01879564864797223,"c":1},{"y":0.58866279054942516,"t":"today many professionals have the weight adjusted during the manufacturing process.","h":0.017531899646320181,"x":0.08008214814781979,"c":1,"w":0.73511291503906251},{"t":"Other changes to the frame involve the handle. Players have individual preferences for the","y":0.62500000011547119,"w":0.77002054850260415,"h":0.016002949852507387,"c":1,"x":0.082135516193971234},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"w":0.78234085083007832,"t":"shape of the handle and some will have the handle of one racket moulded onto the frame of","x":0.080082141218493816,"y":0.64389534904463597},{"x":0.080082139880864059,"t":"a different racket. Other players make different changes. The professional Portuguese player","y":0.65988200581252821,"w":0.78850102742513017,"h":0.017443575338628059,"c":1},{"x":0.082135517498526461,"t":"Gonçalo Oliveira replaced the original grips of his rackets with something thinner because they","y":0.67876106203598141,"h":0.01600637970420804,"w":0.81108830769856777,"c":1},{"t":"had previously felt uncomfortable to hold.","h":0.017497598878753573,"c":1,"w":0.3634496815999349,"x":0.082135528711655748,"y":0.69616519178736824},{"y":0.73097345147968384,"w":0.80698150634765642,"h":0.017699115044247815,"t":"Racket customisation and modification have pushed the standards of the game to greater levels","c":1,"x":0.082135530087692712},{"x":0.080082136114135186,"w":0.8213552347819012,"h":0.017551622418879087,"c":1,"t":"that few could have anticipated in the days of natural strings and heavy, wooden frames, and it's","y":0.75000000002363421},{"w":0.58521560668945316,"t":"exciting to see what further developments there will be in the future.","h":0.017513891799611714,"c":1,"x":0.082135523053205095,"y":0.76744186048596785},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"w":0.026694043477376361,"t":"17","y":0.91860465122679613,"x":0.88911704399026459,"c":1},{"y":0.94166666658950615,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176469618764042,"w":0.45882354736328113,"c":1,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"w":2400,"h":3390}